WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
What's up guys

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.760
We are Pongfinity

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:04.700
Today we'll be playing table tennis
on an X-shaped table

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.920
First I'll try to play against Emil

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.660
And then lets do 2 vs 1 against Miikka

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:19.380
Where are you going?

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.280
Wrong way apparently

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.140
Volley, does it count?

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.640
Yeah that's perfecly legal in X table tennis

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.480
Not really a wise tactic to hit there

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:57.760
That's the special shot!

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.640
Inside out backhand with the edge

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:13.040
Now let's team up against Miikka

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:16.320
I think we are gonna see some running in this match

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:34.640
Good try though!

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:36.120
I'm gonna get this match!

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:44.520
Yes! I found the spot!

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:03.440
That's an evil strategy

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:33.540
I feel a bit like a third wheel here

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:34.880
Very nice running!

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:27.080
Did it touch?

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.360
I think it touched

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:29.400
Sorry!

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:54.520
This is impossible

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.480
But show me some support by subscribing to the channel

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.400
I went for the double bounce

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:49.400
That would have been pretty sick!

00:05:57.740 --> 00:05:59.680
Funny experiment for me and Otto!

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:01.400
That was a bit unfair!

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:03.040
We really enjoyed that one

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:04.260
Remember to hit subscribe

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:06.200
and check our previous videos there

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:07.380
Until next time!

